WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:06.770
<i>I grew up in a large,
 old mansion at the edge of Kyoto</i>

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.770
<b>Kishigami</b>

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:12.030
<i>where I was taught that it was
 wrong to be indiscreet around others.</i>

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.530
Mother, I'm going to school.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.020
<i>I was taught to act with grace,</i>

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.970
<i>maintain a placid temperament, 
and conceal my emotions.</i>

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:35.510
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.290
<i>I loved books since I was a child.</i>

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:59.030
<i>LINE.14  Heart's Wrapping, Heart's Case</i>

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:01.010
<i>I was your typical bookworm who loved 
to daydream of literary worlds.</i>

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.970
<i>But there was one thing different about me.</i>

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.810
Yes, Sensei!

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:09.190
<i>Why are Kitami-kun's arms are so thick?</i>

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.870
<i>No, no. They're all wrong.</i>

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.950
<i>I wonder what the most amazing arms are like.</i>

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.760
<i>I can't tell what they feel like from a book.</i>

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.950
<i>I wonder what's different about them.</i>

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:26.290
<i>No, no. I always think about 
other people's bodies.</i>

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.830
<i>I always stare.</i>

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.110
<i>People would find me 
creepy if they found out.</i>

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.790
<i>And besides, it's rude to stare.</i>

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:36.540
<i>But even though I know it's wrong...</i>

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.140
I want to touch them and feel for myself.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:44.900
<i>I was deeply interested in 
the way human bodies pump blood.</i>

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.680
<i>And in my second year of middle school...</i>

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:50.610
Huh?

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.610
You were here yesterday, too.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.150
And the week before.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:59.210
Th-The sun's nice here.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.910
It's the perfect place to re—

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.780
But you haven't turned a 
single page in a while.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.200
Um, I...

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.120
Do you like road racing?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.580
It's not road racing that I like.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.000
Muscles...

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:12.920
Huh?

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.430
Sorry, it's nothing.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.710
People are always repulsed when they hear it.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.420
If I offended you, I apologize.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.340
Excuse me.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.300
I don't care.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.410
Excuse me. I'm leaving.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.020
I finished reading my book.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.770
<i>That was close.</i>

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:33.850
<i>He nearly heard me when I accidentally 
said "muscles" out loud.</i>

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:39.190
<i>Huh? I didn't say anything 
to Midousuji-san, did I?</i>

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.990
<b>Arashiyama
 Bicycle Park</b>

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.460
<i>I can't. I mustn't say it.</i>

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.870
<i>Nobody can know that I want to touch people.</i>

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.240
<i>I'm in middle school now.</i>

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.830
<i>I need to pull myself together.</i>

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:03.800
<i>I have to act with grace, maintain a placid 
temperament, and conceal my emotions.</i>

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.810
<b>Arashiyama
 Bicycle Park</b>

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:10.180
<i>At first, I really was looking 
for a place to read.</i>

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.270
<i>But...</i>

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:24.930
<i>After coming here a few times, 
my hand stopped turning the page.</i>

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.900
The muscles... Th-They're leaping...

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.250
<i>Bicycle racing...</i>

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.090
<i>It's not like other sports.</i>

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:39.920
<i>The muscles' movements 
before the finish line...</i>

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.260
<i>The way they move their bodies...</i>

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:45.430
<i>No other sports involves 
leaning so far forward.</i>

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.230
Those dancing muscles...

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.600
All kinds of muscles...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.100
If only I could touch them...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.690
No, I mustn't. I swore I wouldn't.

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.190
I swore I wouldn't go back there.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.620
<i>They even ride bicycles in the rain.</i>

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:09.840
<i>No, I just came to check if they were riding.</i>

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.410
<i>That's all. I...</i>

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.710
<i>Midousuji-san's here.</i>

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.290
<i>He surprised me when he suddenly 
spoke to me the other day.</i>

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.760
<i>But I know him.</i>

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.730
<i>After all, he stood out quite a bit.</i>

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.000
<i>He's a third-year, so one year above me.</i>

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.470
<i>He never speaks and is always biking here.</i>

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:35.060
<i>He's stood on the winner's podium
 numerous times, and more than anything...</i>

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.330
Hey, you.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.100
Huh?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.610
You're the kid who always comes to watch.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.150
Are you interested in bicycles?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.730
Are you in middle school?

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:46.130
If you're interested, we have a club.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.170
Why don't you try riding a bike?

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.030
We can rent you a bike.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.120
I'm not interested!

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.080
Huh? What?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:55.770
<i>I'm mentally prepared this time.</i>

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:56.870
It's you.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.890
Yes. My name is Kishigami.

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.840
Um, you even train for 
road races in the rain, don't you?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.140
I thought you were here to read.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.010
Weren't you coming here 
because the sun was nice?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.480
It's raining today.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.120
Oh, um...

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.730
I was just wondering if road 
races were held in the rain.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:23.050
Last time, you said you weren't 
interested in road racing.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:24.190
Well, uh...

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.640
<i>I wanted to have a normal conversation.</i>

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:31.170
<i>"It was cool when you won the other day."</i>

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.410
<i>"It's too bad you got a 
flat tire the other day."</i>

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.710
<i>There are so many things I want 
to say, but I can't say them.</i>

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.410
<i>Not when this man...</i>

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:43.210
<i>Not when his pure eyes, without a 
trace of deceit, are looking at me!</i>

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.110
Gross.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:44.950
What?

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.620
You're gross.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.430
What? Uh... s-sorry!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.330
<i>He's the complete opposite of me.</i>

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.330
<i>He doesn't lie.</i>

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.950
<i>All I do is lie.</i>

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.080
<i>I never reveal my true feelings.</i>

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.380
<i>I'm done for.</i>

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:03.350
<i>Midousuji-san is the best person here.</i>

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.650
<i>He might even be the best in the country.</i>

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.500
<i>His beautiful limbs are long 
and perfectly efficient.</i>

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:13.250
<i>They have just the right amount of muscle.</i>

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.160
<i>And his personality is on a whole other level.</i>

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.750
He's beautiful...

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.380
<i>My heart was pounding that day.</i>

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.630
<i>I want to touch him.</i>

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.180
<i>I want to touch him and see</i>

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:32.180
<i>if what I'm feeling now is real!</i>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.950
I'm really sorry for talking to you.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.140
Excuse me.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:43.560
You won't find anything facing the ground 
and bowing your head all the time.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.010
Those glasses are fake.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:48.480
I...

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:53.740
No. These are for hiding my 
eyes' movements from oth—

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.100
<i>For some reason I say</i>

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.270
<i>things that don't need to be said
 around Midousuji-san.</i>

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.950
<i>It's because of those eyes.</i>

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:04.690
If you keep making superficial 
excuses and trying to fool people,

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:07.130
you'll never see the truth.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:14.820
If you're trying to find something, 
take those ornaments off.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.220
Those decorations.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.300
Decorations...

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:24.550
If you want the truth, you have 
to offer up your entire self.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.650
<i>I ran...</i>

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.950
<i>What are those eyes?</i>

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.100
<i>When he speaks to me,
 those eyes shake my heart.</i>

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.830
<i>Why?</i>

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.980
<i>I want the truth. It's what I really want.</i>

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:47.990
<i>I want to touch them and see for myself.</i>

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.370
<i>I want to know, but I must conceal it.</i>

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.850
<i>Why? Why am I turning back?</i>

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.640
<i>Should I be doing this? Is this
 really the right thing?</i>

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.690
<i>I might be on the verge of opening</i>

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.650
<i>a wrapping that should stay closed!</i>

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.570
Midousuji-san!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.130
I want to touch your muscles!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.580
What should I do?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.110
I see.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.290
What's gotten into you, kid?

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.930
Midousuji's not a girl.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.650
It'd be even worse if he were a girl.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:44.020
Hey, Midousuji. He wants 
to touch your muscles.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.460
Go on and let him.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.050
Muscles...

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.650
<i>This man... I see.</i>

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:56.070
<i>Muscles. Muscles, huh?</i>

00:09:56.070 --> 00:10:00.820
<i>You don't just want to look at muscles,
you want to touch them and see how they feel.</i>

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:06.580
<i>That's your truth!</i>

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.260
Mi... dousuji-san...

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.810
Touching...

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:23.510
Coming in contact with another person's body.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.770
That's not easy.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:30.980
I've always wanted to touch 
them since I was a child.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.800
But I've restrained myself.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.740
I've kept my desire in check.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.610
But I can't anymore.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:42.020
I want to touch you after 
hearing what you said!

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.410
The fence is in the way!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.830
This fence is always getting in the way!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.290
Do you want to cross that 
fence and come over here?

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:51.170
Yes.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:59.130
Then you'll have to ride a bike!

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.700
Yes, I understand.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.350
I'm glad to have an answer.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.250
<i>Since that day,</i>

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.570
<b>Arashiyama
 Bicycle Park</b>

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.280
<i>I've been riding bikes like a man possessed.</i>

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.320
<i>Bicycles are amazing...</i>

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:27.200
<i>Because we're moving at the same speed, 
I can see his leaping muscles up close.</i>

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.310
Hey, are you okay?

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.660
I must go after him immediately!

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.340
I must see more of Midousuji-san!

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.500
He's Kishigami, right? He's good.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.260
He's just a beginner, but he's got guts.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.810
<i>I'm catching up!</i>

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:52.230
Let you touch my muscles?

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.560
Sure, you can.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:58.390
If you can catch me, that is.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:00.940
On a bike.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.490
<i>I will catch up, Midousuji-san!</i>

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.260
<i>Midousuji-san is so kind!</i>

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.320
<i>I will catch up!</i>

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.220
<i>To those muscles!</i>

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.890
<i>Kishigami... huh.</i>

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.670
<i>Was Komari his name?</i>

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.290
<i>He's growing.</i>

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:22.050
<i>His growth since he started riding is 
clearly different from an ordinary person's.</i>

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.940
<i>No, it doesn't matter.</i>

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:30.830
<i>I am me.</i>

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:32.910
<b>Arashiyama
 Bicycle Park</b>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.650
<i>Two years later...</i>

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.860
<b>Kyoto Fushimi High School
Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.970
Isn't that boy with the long hair cool?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.740
<i>I've been wondering about him, too.</i>

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.200
<i>He seems so classy.</i>

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.470
<i>Okay. All the first-years are here.</i>

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.040
<i>Excuse me. Kishigami-kun's not here yet.</i>

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:03.860
<i>I think he's giving Midousuji-kun a 
massage in the club room, at his request.</i>

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.430
<i>Uh, don't worry about him.</i>

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.390
<i>Let's train.</i>

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:15.440
<b>Bicycle
 Racing
 Club</b>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:15.440
<b>Come here
 if you want
 to bike</b>

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.260
He probably joined the team to ride,

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.390
but he's being made to give massages.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.440
I feel sorry for him.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:22.150
It took two years for me to get here.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.030
Thank you, Midousuji-san.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.480
This feels good.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:30.690
I'm not doing this for you.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:35.290
I'm just using you, because you happen 
to be good at giving massages.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.890
This is the best.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:38.750
These are truly good muscles.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.500
They tingle! They flex!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.110
They turn! They bounce!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.410
Oh, look how much!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:46.350
You...

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:50.560
I'm sorry for playing with your muscles.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:53.180
I was so engrossed in them.

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:56.370
But I am fulfilled now.

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.560
I finally got to touch your muscles.

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.980
Is that enough to satisfy you?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.940
What? Yes, of course.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.390
You're letting me touch you.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.860
After all, I can't be greedy.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:12.870
But you must be!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.120
Are you satisfied?

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.420
You're still keeping yourself under wraps.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.260
Huh?

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:23.380
Fulfillment and satisfaction are different.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:30.050
When we first met, you said 
you wanted leaping muscles.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:35.340
Surely stationary muscles like the ones 
you're touching now don't satisfy you.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:39.200
Don't you need to touch moving muscles?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.910
You must crystallize your desires.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:45.360
You must open your wrapping further!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.280
And the case inside that wrapping!

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.490
The case...

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:55.240
Do you want to go to the 
Inter-High this summer?

00:14:55.840 --> 00:15:00.440
The good muscles you desire will 
be swarming all over the place

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:04.250
at the front of the Inter-High!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:16.280
There really are good muscles swarming 
all over the front of the Inter-High,

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.470
Midousuji-san!

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:20.310
700 meters remaining to the sprint line!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.350
Hakone Academy third-year Izumida and 
Kyoto Fushimi third-year Hironishi!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.860
It's a battle of the third-years!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.190
No, wait!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.860
Now that I get a closer look, the pamphlet
 and starting list are different!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.050
Kishigami? Who's that?

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Absent 3rd Hironishi Sakudai
 116 1st Kishigami Komari
 Sub 2nd Kawamoto Kazuya</b>

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.250
They subbed out #116!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:33.870
What?

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.260
That's Kishigami Komari.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:39.300
You can't be serious. He was 
a total newbie until recently.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.270
He didn't even know what gears were.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.670
He's still a first-year!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.870
Seriously?

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.760
First-year against third-year? Wow!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.620
Kishigami!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.970
Go, Kyoto!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.960
Kishigami!

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:51.170
The fans have noticed.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.390
Does hearing these cheers 
not raise your morale?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.180
Not much!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.770
I'm sorry. The heat made me lose my balance.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.760
What was that? A declaration of war?

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.190
A first-year challenging a third-year?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.070
I see. In other words,
 you think you can do it?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:12.120
Is that what you heard?

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:15.590
Yes. After all, I'll win.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:20.390
I can't reach leaping muscles 
if I cross the line from behind.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.920
In order to touch the ultimate muscles,

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.380
I must cross the finish line first!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.550
600 meters to go!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.430
Until then, my hands are 
bound to these handles.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:37.180
You don't have to worry.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.650
I've kept myself under wraps for a long time!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.380
Despite my behavior,
 I have a lot of restraint!

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.300
<i>Pressure...</i>

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.930
<i>And not as another participant.</i>

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:48.940
<i>Pressure as a human. He's strong.</i>

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:52.990
Interesting. It seems 
you're a worthy opponent.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:56.950
I'll win. And Hakone Academy will 
achieve its first true victory!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.180
Muscles don't lie!

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.580
Let's race, Kishigami-kun!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.080
Let's see who crosses the sprint line first!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.910
Are you ready?

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.580
Here we go, Andy, Frank. It's our final...

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.630
<i>Our final job!</i>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.170
500 meters remain to the Inter-High's 
second day's sprint line!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.200
<i>We'll take the sprint!</i>

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.350
Abs, abs, abs, abs, abs, abs!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.970
Buaaa!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.350
<i>I am a sprinter...</i>

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.310
<i>Tag #14.</i>

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.850
<i>The man bearing the proud 
Hakone Academy's #4.</i>

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.610
<i>I am simultaneously the 
captain who carries the team.</i>

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:34.350
<i>I must always make the right call.</i>

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:37.770
<i>I must always make decisions,
 and I must always achieve results.</i>

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.490
<i>Our reputation transformed 
from "strong" and "amazing"</i>

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.150
<i>to "it's expected" and "the natural outcome."</i>

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:47.350
<i>And in order to carry on
 that tradition, I work tirelessly.</i>

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:51.140
<i>I give my time, I give my spirit,</i>

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:54.420
<i>and I give my body and soul 
to become stronger and faster.</i>

00:17:54.420 --> 00:18:00.430
<i>But there's an old saying in the 
Hakone Academy bicycle racing club.</i>

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:03.070
<i>"Don't expect praise from anyone."</i>

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:06.430
<i>"Otherwise, you can't be the 
Captain of Hakone Academy."</i>

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.640
Resolve?

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:09.560
That's right.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.110
No one will praise you for your efforts.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.460
O-Of course not.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:18.530
Hard work isn't something you do to be seen.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:22.170
Will you be able to say those 
words under all circumstances?

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.570
When things get hard? 
When you want to give up?

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.040
When you desire recognition?

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.810
You're only human. Those moments
 will come eventually.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:36.050
But you must suppress them, swallow them, 
shake them off, and keep on working.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:41.470
"If only someone would say something kind 
to me, I could try a little harder."

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.640
If you've ever thought that,
 abandon that hope.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.450
You won't get it.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.640
We're expected to be strong. 
We're expected to win.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.860
After all, Hakone Academy are the champions.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:55.500
Can you move forward without praise?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.300
Can you charge full speed 
through the darkness?

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:02.370
Can you carry everything and win, 
no matter the circumstances?

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.570
That's the resolve it takes to be the captain

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.430
of the Hakone Academy Bicycle Racing Club.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.210
Yes...

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.580
Yes, sir!

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.960
<i>I will win, no matter the circumstances.</i>

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:16.210
<i>A sprinter is a pointed spear.</i>

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:22.180
<i>In the past year, I have been polishing 
this spear while no one was watching.</i>

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:26.450
My spear will pierce the line faster 
and more beautifully than anyone else!

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.020
Abs!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.320
Abs! Abs!

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:29.630
Abs! Abs!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.020
Abs!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.780
I told you, I can read your movements.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.690
I just told you.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.690
#116's reactions are so fast!

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.750
He caught up, even though Izumida accelerated!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:44.410
It's like #116 was already 
moving by the time Izumida moved!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.890
Muscles are honest. Fakes don't work.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:50.410
You order them to move, 
and they enter the motion.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:54.240
They begin moving hundredths of 
seconds before they enter the motion.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.010
Especially yours, Izumida-san.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.050
Your muscles are particularly honest.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:01.050
And I won't miss a thing.

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:05.930
I will win because I know everything 
you'll do before the finish line!

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:14.900
<i>He's in front?</i>

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.220
Kyoto Fushimi's accelerating now?

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:18.860
Hakone Academy got a late start!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.740
There's 300 meters remaining 
to the sprint line!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.930
<i>He took advantage of a moment's opening!</i>

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:25.530
<i>I can't believe he's jumping ahead now!</i>

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:28.940
<i>He'll conserve his energy 
until the last hundred meters</i>

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.620
<i>and match my pace, then attack at the end.</i>

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:36.250
<i>So I just need to make sure I 
don't go all out until the end.</i>

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:42.260
<i>Did you see the slight slackness in my muscles 
when I thought that, Kishigami Komari?</i>

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.630
Kyoto Fushimi's staying ahead!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:47.890
Abs, abs, abs!

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.550
There's 200 meters left!

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:53.060
After the corner, there's only 
80 meters to the sprint line!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.400
Is he going to do it?

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:57.790
First-year Kishigami is about 
to upset Hakone Academy!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.090
Kishigami!

00:20:58.670 --> 00:20:59.770
Kishigami!

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:00.280
Kyoto Fushimi!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.710
<i>I don't care about their cheers.</i>

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.650
<i>I want to touch muscles. That's all.</i>

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:08.990
<i>There's nothing blocking me anymore!</i>

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:12.130
You spilled it. I told you so.

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:14.040
Here, wrap it up with this.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.500
Wrap it up.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:19.890
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:25.050
<i>Wrap...?</i>

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.850
I won't wrap up anything anymore!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.890
There's 100 meters to the sprint line!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:10.330
Yamaguchi-san, this is a gift from me.

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:11.240
Huh?

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>Kishigami got a gift? For me?</i>

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.500
<i>What's with this box? Why is it closed?</i>

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.080
<i>He must be up to something.</i>

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.990
<i>It's preposterous for him to give me a gift.</i>

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>Why me? This is terrifying!</i>

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:25.110
You're not going to open it?

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:26.460
Oh, yeah...

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.110
It's sakuramochi. It's good.

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:40.060
<i>NEXT LINE  The Sprint Line of Delight</i>

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:45.060
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:51.250
<b>Don't miss the next episode</b>
